{
  "_comment": [
    "Offline identity diagnostics. No model calls: every case is scored by",
    "app/evaluation/identity_scoring.py against PIIMasker and resolve_child_name.",
    "",
    "'profile' is a repo-relative path, or an inline object for cases that need",
    "a profile shape the shared fixture does not cover (e.g. a stored surname).",
    "",
    "must_mask       - PII that must NOT survive the mask, in any casing.",
    "must_not_mask   - ordinary words / third-party names whose occurrence count",
    "                  must be preserved exactly.",
    "Every case is additionally checked for placeholder token integrity (no",
    "placeholder welded to adjacent word characters) and mask/unmask round-trip."
  ],

